These are information criteria, so "better" might not be the best description. According to BIC, which has a higher standard for sample size information and model parsimony, the first model is better. If sample size is less of a factor, and only model parsimony is the goal, then AIC suggests the second model. It depends on what you think is more informative in your empirical context.

Phil

